RELEASE_NOTE = "Dependency security patch. Bumped cryptography 44->50, Flask-Cors 5->6 (CORS policy fixes), requests 2.32->2.33, marshmallow 3.23->3.26 (controller); cryptography 44->50, requests 2.32->2.33 (agent); asyncssh 2.19->2.24 (console-proxy); axios ->1.20 (frontend). Clears the large majority of reported CVEs. Two advisories intentionally deferred/accepted and documented in SECURITY-NOTES.md: paramiko SHA-1 (no upstream fix; low risk) and react-router v6 SSR advisories (N/A to this client-side SPA; v7 upgrade deferred to a tested change). No functional changes."
